              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "AKU's primary mission is the development of quality human resources that are trained to respond to the unique needs of the developing world. This talk by Ahmad Faraz at AKU is part of the University's special lecture series, featuring lectures by prominent personalities with the aim of providing students with a broad-based education to enrich their understanding and appreciation of the humanities and social sciences. The interaction with distinguished personalities also benefits the faculty, staff and the general public. ",
